      "title": "PROFINET: Add secure SXP SAM and SCM dissection",
      "message": "PROFINET: Add secure SXP SAM and SCM dissection\n\nAdd PROFINET 2.50 Security Association Management and Security\nConfiguration Management decoding for SXP.\n\nDecode current SAM and SCM request and response blocks while preserving\nthe legacy security block handlers. Add DevID domain, certificate,\ncertification path, CSR, security capability, and configuration\nparameter fields.\n\nCorrect the ARAlgorithmInfoBlock and ExpectedCredentialTypeBlock\nlayouts. Bound all current security block members by their declared\nlengths so malformed input cannot consume subsequent blocks.\n\nDecode the secure SXP wrapper according to IEC 61784-6-3. Expose\nSecurityMetaData and SecurityChecksum for authentication-only packets,\nthen pass the cleartext SXP packet data through normal service\nreassembly. Preserve authenticated-encryption payloads as bounded\nopaque SecurityData.\n\nAlso update PNIOStatus mappings for SXP, RTAv3, PNIOSEC, and legacy\nprotocol-machine values. Add PRAL alarm item and AR record access\npolicy block dissection, refresh record indexes and IOCRProperties,\nand correct DCP and SXP display labels.\n\nValidated the changes with a secure SXP capture and repository API checks.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes [GitHub Copilot]\n",
      "author_name": "Dominik Wagner",
      "author_email": "dominikwagner@siemens.com",
